@CoreApiRest_HostAddress = http://localhost:5160

POST {{CoreApiRest_HostAddress}}/api/v1/quotes/calculate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "peso": 5.0,
  "tipoCliente": "Regular",
  "tipoEnvio": "Estandar"
}

###

POST {{CoreApiRest_HostAddress}}/api/v1/quotes/calculate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "peso": 20.01,
  "tipoCliente": "VIP",
  "tipoEnvio": "Express"
}

### 1. Caso Exitoso (200 OK) - Reglas BR-02, BR-03, BR-04 válidas
POST {{CoreApiRest_HostAddress}}/api/v1/quotes/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "peso": 5.5,
  "tipoCliente": "Corporativo",
  "tipoEnvio": "Express"
}

### 2. Error de Negocio (422 Unprocessable Entity) - Regla BR-02 (Peso > 20kg)
POST {{CoreApiRest_HostAddress}}/api/v1/quotes/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "peso": 22.5,
  "tipoCliente": "Regular",
  "tipoEnvio": "Estandar"
}

### 3. Error Sintáctico / Validación DTO (400 Bad Request) - Payload inválido
POST {{CoreApiRest_HostAddress}}/api/v1/quotes/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "peso": -5.0,
  "tipoCliente": "",
  "tipoEnvio": null
}